    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "\"Today, the complete volume of Elliott’s sketches from the 1869 expedition is\r\nmaintained in the U.S. Geological Survey Denver Library Field Records collection.\r\nThis Open-File Report combines Hayden’s 1869 Preliminary Field Report of the\r\nUnited States Geological Survey of Colorado and New Mexico and the complete\r\nvolume of Elliott’s sketches. Descriptions of the sketches closely follow USGS\r\nField Records administrator Carol Edwards’ catalog notes.\"",
